   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "1 Demand"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1f46a375-58c8-4c5e-b475-65669b7550cc",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Problem-oriented guides, templates, calculators and business resources create discovery opportunities before product selection."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9bfef180-a928-4421-887e-fad7ce32da7c",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "2 Trust"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "7d939693-5357-4f0f-9521-4afad918da31",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Customer stories plus accountant/bookkeeper relationships add proof and professional influence."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "16c001c0-1419-43bc-ba9d-7b64c5dbe206",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "3 Conversion"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "daf8fec0-c4e2-41c8-ab6e-5b14cc09a3b6",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Free-trial path reduces evaluation friction."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0187b800-5bac-4b6e-a728-880659556a61",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "4 Channel multiplication"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "67e125a2-f8b3-422c-9fa8-cd1b49ade717",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Partner toolkit gives third parties campaign assets, SEO/social guidance, email templates, webinars and campaigns."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "160fda2d-ff5a-4efa-b6ee-451baa3f3ad7",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "5 Measurement gap"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "6001cdea-6ba2-43ce-a352-da3110879663",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Public evidence confirms capabilities; it does not provide comparable CAC or channel revenue attribution."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-25T20:11:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0b11021c-9920-4024-8176-af9f84befed5",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Reusable architecture: utility/content + professional trust + low-friction evaluation + partner amplification."
   ],
